  "description": "Rough and fierce delinquent Jang Tae-ho gets dragged to a countryside house on the first day of summer vacation due to his parents' scheme(?). What awaits him there is none other than the gangster princess Min Ju-ah! Min Ju-ah points a gun at the bewildered Jang Tae-ho and says... \"I kidnapped you here to make you my subordinate.\" A chaotic summer vacation story of delinquent Jang Tae-ho and gangster princess Min Ju-ah!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
